        }
      },
      "id": 12,
      "description": "prometheus_sd_discovered_targets 按 config(即 prometheus.yml 里的每个 scrape 配置)统计服务发现发现到的目标数,实测合计 14 个(api/ai-service/loki/promtail/alertmanager/alertbridge/windows/postgres/redis/rsshub/cloudflared 等)。数字变少=有 job 配错被丢掉;变多=新增了抓取项。"
    },
    {
      "title": "Loki 请求速率(按 route)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(loki_request_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 13,
      "description": "对 loki_request_duration_seconds_count 取 5 分钟速率并按 route 拆分(实测 17 条路由,主力是 /logproto.Pusher/Push 与 loki_api_v1_push 约 0.4/s、grpc 健康检查 0.33/s)。读法:push 路由的速率就是 Promtail 的写入吞吐,掉到 0 说明日志链路断了。"
    },
    {
      "title": "Loki 请求耗时(P95 与平均)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(loki_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(loki_request_duration_seconds_sum[5m])) / sum(rate(loki_request_duration_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "平均"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 14,
      "description": "两条线都来自 loki_request_duration_seconds 直方图(已实测 _bucket 与 _sum 均存在):A 是对全部路由合并后的 P95(实测约 5ms),B 是 _sum/_count 算出的平均耗时(实测约 0.55ms)。P95 明显高于平均说明有长尾慢请求,通常出现在查询路由而非写入路由。"
    },
    {
      "title": "Loki 5xx 错误率",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(loki_request_duration_seconds_count{status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(loki_request_duration_seconds_count[5m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "5xx 占比"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "id": 15,
      "description": "loki_request_duration_seconds_count 带 status_code 标签(gRPC 路由上是 success 而非数字),用 status_code=~\"5..\" 挑 HTTP 5xx 算占比。实测近 5 分钟为 0(合法零基线:全量计数里 status_code=500 只出现过 1 次)。非 0 时先看 loki_api_v1_push 的 500 —— 那是日志写入被拒,会直接丢日志。"
    },
    {
      "title": "Promtail 日志读取速率(Top5 文件)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 21
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(5, sum by (path) (rate(promtail_read_bytes_total[5m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{path}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 16,
      "description": "promtail_read_bytes_total 按 path 记录每个被 tail 文件的累计读取字节,取 5 分钟速率后 topk(5)(实测 337 个文件里 svc-api-nssm.log 约 400B/s 居首)。读法:哪条线长期归零说明该文件已停写或被轮转;整体归零说明业务日志彻底不落盘。注意 promtail_log_entries_total 本机无序列,所以这里只能用字节速率代替条目速率。"
    },
    {
      "title": "告警桥自监控",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(ihui_alertbridge_alerts_received_total)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "累计接收告警"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(ihui_alertbridge_mail_undelivered)",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "邮件未投递"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"]
        }
      },
      "id": 17,
      "description": "告警桥(job=alertbridge)自曝的两个数:ihui_alertbridge_alerts_received_total 是从 Alertmanager webhook 收到的告警累计数(实测 22),ihui_alertbridge_mail_undelivered 是当前未投递成功的邮件数(实测 0,合法零基线)。未投递 >0 就是告警发不出去,属于监控栈最严重的故障之一。"
    },
    {
      "title": "Prometheus 规则评估耗时(按分位)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 28
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "prometheus_rule_evaluation_duration_seconds",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "q={{quantile}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 18,
      "description": "prometheus_rule_evaluation_duration_seconds 是 Prometheus 评估告警规则的耗时 summary,带 quantile 标签(实测 q=0.5/0.9 为 0、q=0.99 约 1ms —— 近窗规则极轻,属合法零基线)。读法:分位线持续抬升说明某条规则表达式太重,会拖慢整个评估周期甚至导致告警延迟。"
    }
  ],
